_categories":"Bars, Mexican, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"mCRa6o1eEVQr1bqV4Wy6KQ","review_id":"DDhSdYjDbL1Mo-Ryt6gSdA","date":"2014-04-17T17:26:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9572803974151611,"text_excerpt":"Lively place with the often-mentioned 25-cent oyster happy hour... it was packed on the Monday night that we visited, and service was a bit slow as a result, but friendly & cheerful. Yes, they limit the number of oysters you can order at one time, but that's because they can only shuck so many at a time. We sat right next to the shucking station & talked to the guys busting their butts right up until the end of happy hour. Just ask your server to put you down for another dozen when your turn comes around again. They were perfectly happy to bring us more as long as we didn't monopolize the supply. They had a nice selection of local brews on tap, Abita & NOLA Brown & Canebreak. Loved it, wa..."},{"business_id":"mCRa6o1eEVQr1bqV4Wy6KQ","review_id":"9Zz9mALq6KfsuhAtezwwnw","date":"2015-05-13T20:00:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9569520354270935,"text_excerpt":"BLUF: Amazing oyster happy hour. Good atmosphere and staff. $0.25 oysters for happy hour. That is crazy. You have to drink for each order but that is just as fun. They have a standard beer list. When we were there they were out of half of the beers which was annoying but no big deal. Waiter was super nice and helpful. We saw full meals coming out that looked good but didnt have anythign but the oysters which were big and good. We had raw and chard. Both were great. Lots of young people having a good time. Lots of outdoor seating plus indoor. Good place to get bar hop."},{"business_id":"mCRa6o1eEVQr1bqV4Wy6KQ","review_id":"3R8wPEyB5_CUVAd2Rn5WNQ","date":"2017-08-16T13:13:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9526517987251282,"text_excerpt":"For my first taste of raw oysters this was the right place. The gulf oysters were so fresh. Happy hour was really cheap and late until 8 pm. The drinks are strong as well. I'll definitely be back for some of their broiled oysters too. The view is nice on their balcony. The wait staff was very friendly"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"mCRa6o1eEVQr1bqV4Wy6KQ","photo_id":"6nJg8p9bYNATyBmDUaBaZA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/6nJg8p9bYNATyBmDUaBaZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9050346612930298},{"business_id":"mCRa6o1eEVQr1bqV4Wy6KQ","photo_id":"6WwNW4QkZQ5p84s57EL5ig","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6WwNW4QkZQ5p84s57EL5ig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8712893128395081},{"business_id":"mCRa6o1eEVQr1bqV4Wy6KQ","photo_id":"-XmUzYHN690eh-Q5ItfedA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-XmUzYHN690eh-Q5ItfedA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.859